== Test Tier 1 selection, liveness and native fragments
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-tier1-select --manifest > build/tier1-plan-manifest.csv
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-tier1-liveness
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-tier1-emit
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-tier1-pipeline --cross-check
# #179: hand-written IR of AVX-512's masks (and #141's vectors) through Tier 1's selection and CFG consumer, natively
# against the IR's interpreter where the host has every feature of x86-64-v4 (compiled and checked only elsewhere).
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-tier1-masks
# #141: the 128-bit integers split into 64-bit halves (ir_wide.c): hand-written and random 128-bit IR and Tier 0's random
# 128-bit programs through the split, the optimizer and Tier 1 natively, against the IR's interpreter and the programs'
# stack machine.
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-tier1-wide
# #179's measure-mask-spills programs: encoded alike by both encoders, and their masks' values where the host runs them.
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-mask-spills
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-tier1-model
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" measure-tier1-model --manifest build/tier1-plan-manifest.csv --verify
== Test the partial Zen 5 model and instruction harness
"$BUSTER_COMPILER" test-x86-zen5
